  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased capacity of the constituents to prevent and address violence and harassment at work</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At the global level, the ILO will:
(1) undertake research on effective approaches to prevent and address violence and harassment at work, including using behavioural science; 
(2) promote ratification and implementation of Convention No. 190 through advocacy and practical tools; 
(3) develop approaches to address violence and harassment in informality, supply chains and crisis contexts, considering technological change; 
(4) expand evidence on prevalence, forms and impacts, including for those facing intersecting discrimination; and 
(5) advance methodologies and guidance for measuring violence and harassment at work.</narrative>
  </description>
